      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report a case of autotransplantation performed 21 years ago in a patient suffering from intractable loin pain. Long-term followup, the pathogenesis of pain in regard to renal innervation and the value of autotransplantation as a form of complete sensory denervation are discussed."},
